  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote teachers policies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By building on previous years&#x2019; achievements, our Teacher programme is focusing on developing both institutional and human capacities of those responsible for developing and implementing forward-looking teacher policies in the Arab countries. Our efforts will be oriented towards further informing effective teacher policies based on the Tarbiyah21 Repository of Promising Teaching and Learning Practices that will be expanded by focusing on ECCE. The programme will also include policy dialogue to deal with teacher shortage issues in Arab countries through effective capacity development and incentives. As TES follow up, special attention will be also given to teacher roles in transforming education through whole-school approaches, especially regarding digital transformation of education and greening education, as well as enhancing teacher and learner well-being in both mainstream and crisis situations.</narrative>
  </description>
